flowchart TD
    A["抽象争论陷入僵局（Stalled abstract debate）"] --> B["搭一次性交互装置（Build a disposable artifact）"]
    B --> C["关键假设做成滑杆：市场规模、获客、成本、监管拖累（Assumptions as sliders）"]
    C --> D["利益相关方动手改输入（Stakeholders move the inputs）"]
    D --> E{"仍不同意结论？（Still reject the conclusion?）"}
    E -- "是" --> F["必须指认否认哪条假设、换成什么值（Name the rejected assumption）"]
    F --> C
    E -- "否" --> G["分歧的真实来源浮出并消解（Real disagreement surfaced）"]
    G --> H["装置即弃，再投入真实构建（Discard, then build for real）"]
    classDef core fill:#1a5fd0,stroke:#12449e,color:#ffffff;
    classDef gate fill:#fdf0ef,stroke:#e0b4b4,color:#8a3a34;
    classDef out fill:#edf1f7,stroke:#c9d6e6,color:#182430;
    class B,C,D,F core;
    class E gate;
    class A,G,H out;
